{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-06-17 15:00:00', 'title': 'IBM CLOSES ACQUISITION OF TURBONOMIC TO DELIVER COMPREHENSIVE AIOPS CAPABILITIES FOR HYBRID CLOUD', 'text': "COMPLEMENTS RECENT ACQUISITION OF INSTANA AND LAUNCH OF IBM CLOUD PAK FOR WATSON AIOPS TO ADDRESS AI-DRIVEN AUTOMATION OF IT; POWERED BY RED HAT OPENSHIFT TO RUN ANYWHERE ACQUISITION BUILDS ON IBM'S GROWING INVESTMENT IN ITS ECOSYSTEM PARTNERS INCLUDING CISCO TO HELP CUSTOMERS ACCELERATE THEIR JOURNEY TO HYBRID CLOUD AND AI ARMONK, N.Y., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF ITS ACQUISITION OF TURBONOMIC, INC., AN APPLICATION RESOURCE MANAGEMENT (ARM) AND NETWORK PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT (NPM) SOFTWARE PROVIDER BASED IN BOSTON, MA."}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-06-17 08:30:00', 'title': "IBM DIGITAL HEALTH PASS TO INTEGRATE WITH CLX HEALTH'S TRUSTASSURE™ PLATFORM", 'text': "ARMONK, N.Y., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IBM (NYSE: IBM) AND CLX HEALTH TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO INTEGRATE IBM DIGITAL HEALTH PASS WITH CLX HEALTH'S TRUSTASSURE™ PLATFORM TO HELP PROVIDE INDIVIDUALS WITH A SEAMLESS, SECURE WAY TO LOCATE AND SCHEDULE A COVID-19 TEST WITH A PROVIDER AND CREATE A VERIFIABLE CREDENTIAL TO USE, IF NEEDED, WHEN RETURNING TO PHYSICAL LOCATIONS, SUCH AS AN AIRPLANE, SPORTS STADIUM OR WORKPLACE."}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-06-17 08:00:00', 'title': 'IBM COLLABORATES WITH 30 ORGANIZATIONS TO RE-SKILL & CONNECT THE WORKFORCE WITH REAL CAREER OPPORTUNITIES', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y., JUNE 17, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AT VIVATECH\xa0TODAY, IBM (NYSE: IBM) CEO\xa0ARVIND KRISHNA ANNOUNCED A NEW COLLABORATION WITH 30 GLOBAL ORGANIZATIONS INCLUDING GOVERNMENTS, COMMUNITY COLLEGES, NON-PROFITS, AND EMPLOYMENT AGENCIES, FOCUSED ON HELPING UNDERSERVED POPULATIONS IMPROVE THEIR SKILLS AND EMPLOYABILITY.'}